incinnati’s Tangeman University Center floor plan labels a Study Lounge in the North Wing.","source_url":"https://www.uc.edu/content/dam/refresh/tuc/common/tangeman-floorplan.pdf","source_title":"Tangeman University Center Floor Plan","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-11-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check the current TUC floor plan and building access information before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"campus-recreation-climbing-wall","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Campus Recreation Center Climbing Wall","title":"Try the CRC Climbing Wall","subtitle":"Campus Recreation Center, 2820 Bearcat Way","notes":"Visit during posted wall hours for a staffed climb or bouldering session; ask staff about required waivers and belay procedures before participating.","short_summary":"A staffed climbing and bouldering facility within the CRC.","evidence_claim":"UC describes the Campus Recreation Center Climbing Wall as having 28- and 40-foot top-rope areas and a bouldering wall; harness and shoe rentals are free.","source_url":"https://www.uc.edu/campus-life/campus-rec/crc/climbing-wall.html","source_title":"Campus Recreation Center Climbing Wall","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The page lists summer hours of Monday–Thursday, 5–8 p.m.; access is for members and event groups, with safety policies applying.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"bearcats-pantry-resource-center","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Bearcats Pantry and Resource Center","title":"Use the Bearcats Pantry Resource Center","subtitle":"Stratford Heights Building 16, Room 101","notes":"Create a PantrySOFT account and bring your physical Bearcat Card to access groceries or supplies; plan around the published weekly v